---
import BaseLayout from '../../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
const locale = 'en';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Reporting & Management Insight — Dashboards, Analytics, BSC"
  description="Real-time dashboards, management reports, drill-down analytics, AI-powered commentary, strategic KPI tracking, and balanced scorecard. Part of Kraal Code ERP."
  locale={locale}
  canonicalUrl="https://kraalcode.com/en/capabilities/reporting/"
>
  <section class="page-hero section--warm">
    <div class="container">
      <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><ol><li><a href="/en/">Home</a></li><li><a href="/en/capabilities/">Capabilities</a></li><li aria-current="page">Reporting & Management Insight</li></ol></nav>
      <h1>Reporting & Management Insight</h1>
      <p class="page-hero-subtext">Every module feeds one reporting layer. Real-time dashboards, financial statements, operational reports, and strategic KPIs — all from the same data.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Who this is for</h2>
    <p>CEOs, directors, department heads, and anyone who needs to see what is happening across the organisation — without waiting for month-end reports or asking someone to run a query.</p>
    <p>If you sit on a board, manage a department, report to donors, or need to make decisions based on current data rather than last month's spreadsheets, this module replaces manual report preparation with live, role-based dashboards.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container">
    <h2>What you can do</h2>
    <div class="feature-grid">
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Executive Dashboard</h3><p>Today's sales, monthly performance with achievement bars, low stock alerts, gross margin, active customers, and 12-month trend charts. The first screen a managing director sees.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Accounting Dashboard</h3><p>Total assets, liabilities, equity, and net profit at a glance. Current ratio, debt-to-equity, and profit margin with Healthy/Fair/Weak indicators. Trial balance status.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Sales Manager Dashboard</h3><p>Sales performance by rep, territory, and product. Pipeline visibility. Achievement against targets. Top customers and overdue accounts.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Store Dashboard</h3><p>Active stores, total stock value, low stock items, inventory by location with utilisation bars, pending transfers, and expiring batches with urgency badges.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Procurement Dashboard</h3><p>Open purchase requests, open POs, GRNs today, pending invoices, AP total with overdue aging, and quick actions for procurement officers.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>KPI Dashboard</h3><p>Strategic KPIs with targets and actuals. Track performance across financial, customer, internal process, and learning perspectives. Linked to the balanced scorecard.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Compliance Dashboard</h3><p>Monitor compliance status across the organisation. Track audit findings, corrective actions, and regulatory requirements. Generate compliance reports for boards and regulators.</p></div>
      <div class="feature-card"><h3>Financial Statements</h3><p>Profit and loss, balance sheet, cash flow statement, and trial balance. Departmental and consolidated views. Export to PDF or Excel. Configurable reporting periods.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>How it connects</h2>
    <p>Reporting is not a separate module — it is the lens through which every other module is visible. Every dashboard pulls from the same live data:</p>
    <ul class="connection-list">
      <li><strong>Accounting</strong> → financial statements, budgets, trial balance, cash flow</li>
      <li><strong>Sales</strong> → sales trends, customer analytics, agent performance, pipeline</li>
      <li><strong>Inventory</strong> → stock levels, valuation, movement history, reorder alerts</li>
      <li><strong>Procurement</strong> → spend analysis, vendor performance, AP aging</li>
      <li><strong>HR</strong> → headcount, payroll costs, leave balances, appraisal scores</li>
      <li><strong>Manufacturing</strong> → production efficiency, yield, QC statistics, WIP value</li>
      <li><strong>Strategy & BSC</strong> → strategic objectives, KPIs, departmental workplans</li>
    </ul>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section section--warm"><div class="container container--narrow">
    <h2>Controls and permissions</h2>
    <div class="controls-grid">
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Role-Based Dashboards</h3><p>Each user sees only the dashboards relevant to their role. Finance sees accounting dashboards; sales managers see sales dashboards. No cross-department data leakage.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Data Access Scoping</h3><p>Reports respect the same permission boundaries as transactions. A branch manager sees only their branch data. A department head sees only their department's costs.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Export Controls</h3><p>Data exports (PDF, Excel) are logged with user and timestamp. Sensitive reports (financial statements, payroll summaries) require additional approval before export.</p></div>
      <div class="control-item"><h3>Audit Trail</h3><p>Every report generation, export, and dashboard configuration change is logged. INSERT-only records. Report access history available for compliance reviews.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container">
    <h2>See it in action</h2>
    <p class="screenshot-intro">Screenshots from the live Kraal Code system — coming soon.</p>
    <div class="screenshot-grid">
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Executive Dashboard</span><span class="screenshot-note">Live product screenshot — coming soon</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">KPI Dashboard</span><span class="screenshot-note">Live product screenshot — coming soon</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Compliance Dashboard</span><span class="screenshot-note">Live product screenshot — coming soon</span></div></div>
      <div class="screenshot-slot"><div class="screenshot-placeholder"><span class="screenshot-label">Financial Statements</span><span class="screenshot-note">Live product screenshot — coming soon</span></div></div>
    </div>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section--dark section"><div class="container text-center">
    <h2>See reporting in action</h2>
    <p>Request a demonstration tailored to your management reporting needs.</p>
    <a href="/en/contact/" class="btn btn--inverse">Request a Demonstration →</a>
  </div></section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .page-hero {
    padding: var(--kc-space-20) 0 var(--kc-space-12);
  }
  .page-hero h1 {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-4xl);
    max-width: 700px;
  }
  .page-hero-subtext {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-lg);
    color: var(--kc-text-secondary);
    max-width: 60ch;
    margin-top: var(--kc-space-4);
  }
  .breadcrumb ol {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    display: flex;
    gap: var(--kc-space-2);
    font-size: var(--kc-text-sm);
    color: var(--kc-text-tertiary);
    margin-bottom: var(--kc-space-6);
  }
  .breadcrumb a {
    color: var(--kc-teal);
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .breadcrumb li:not(:last-child)::after {
    content: '/';
    margin-left: var(--kc-space-2);
    color: var(--kc-text-tertiary);
  }
  .container--narrow {
    max-width: var(--kc-container-narrow);
  }
  .container--narrow p {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-base);
    color: var(--kc-text-secondary);
    line-height: var(--kc-leading-relaxed);
    margin-bottom: var(--kc-space-4);
  }
  .feature-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--kc-space-6);
    margin-top: var(--kc-space-8);
  }
  .feature-card {
    padding: var(--kc-space-6);
    background: var(--kc-surface-light);
    border: 1px solid var(--kc-border-subtle);
    border-radius: var(--kc-radius-lg);
  }
  .feature-card h3 {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-lg);
    font-family: var(--kc-font-body);
    font-weight: var(--kc-weight-semibold);
    margin-bottom: var(--kc-space-2);
  }
  .feature-card p {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-sm);
    color: var(--kc-text-secondary);
  }
  .connection-list {
    margin-top: var(--kc-space-4);
  }
  .connection-list li {
    margin-bottom: var(--kc-space-3);
    font-size: var(--kc-text-base);
    color: var(--kc-text-secondary);
  }
  .connection-list strong {
    color: var(--kc-text-primary);
  }
  .controls-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--kc-space-6);
    margin-top: var(--kc-space-6);
  }
  .control-item {
    padding: var(--kc-space-5);
    border-left: 3px solid var(--kc-teal);
  }
  .control-item h3 {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-base);
    font-family: var(--kc-font-body);
    font-weight: var(--kc-weight-semibold);
    margin-bottom: var(--kc-space-1);
  }
  .control-item p {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-sm);
    color: var(--kc-text-secondary);
  }
  .screenshot-intro {
    color: var(--kc-text-secondary);
    margin-bottom: var(--kc-space-6);
  }
  .screenshot-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: var(--kc-space-6);
  }
  .screenshot-placeholder {
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 10;
    background: var(--kc-surface-warm);
    border: 2px dashed var(--kc-border);
    border-radius: var(--kc-radius-lg);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: var(--kc-space-2);
  }
  .screenshot-label {
    font-weight: var(--kc-weight-semibold);
    color: var(--kc-text-primary);
  }
  .screenshot-note {
    font-size: var(--kc-text-sm);
    color: var(--kc-text-tertiary);
  }
  .btn--inverse {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: var(--kc-space-4) var(--kc-space-8);
    font-weight: var(--kc-weight-semibold);
    font-size: var(--kc-text-base);
    border-radius: var(--kc-radius-lg);
    background: transparent;
    color: var(--kc-text-inverse);
    border: 2px solid var(--kc-teal-light);
    transition: all var(--kc-transition-fast);
    text-decoration: none;
    margin-top: var(--kc-space-6);
  }
  .btn--inverse:hover {
    background: var(--kc-teal);
    border-color: var(--kc-teal);
  }
  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .page-hero h1 {
      font-size: var(--kc-text-3xl);
    }
    .feature-grid,
    .controls-grid,
    .screenshot-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
